<title>SRI LANKA: Haycarb up 10 pct on bonus news.</title>
<headline>Haycarb up 10 pct on bonus news.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Haycarb Ltd rose 10 percent or nine rupees to 99, in early Monday trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The share is moving up after the bonus announcement,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>The company said it was issuing one bonus share for every six held. Its issued capital would rise accordingly to 19.4 million shares, from 16.6 million.</p>
<p>The firm, a subsidiary of blue chip Hayleys Ltd, manufactures and exports activated carbon.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
